            "icon": "none",
            "image_height": 55,
            "image_border_radius": false,
            "title": "Stunning design",
            "text": "<p>Indulge your senses with the mesmerizing visual appeal of the B&O A9's stunning design. Experience the irresistible visual charm of the B&O A9's striking design.</p>",
